#: R/shared-helpers.R
msgid ""
"A blank dCor cell means the statistic could not be computed for that pair "
"(e.g. one of the variables has zero variance, or there are too few complete "
"cases) - it does not imply zero dependence."
msgstr ""

#: R/texts.R
msgid ""
"A case is flagged on leverage when it exceeds 2p/n (p = estimated "
"parameters, including the intercept; n = cases), and on Cook's distance "
"when it exceeds 4/n."
msgstr ""

#: R/anovacheck.b.R
msgid "A covariate shows possible curvature."
