#: R/pathcheck.b.R
msgid ""
"Because this OLS-based path analysis estimates each equation separately, "
"multivariate normality is not required for the coefficients or their "
"significance tests to be valid; this diagnostic mainly matters if the same "
"model is later re-specified as an SEM estimated by maximum likelihood, "
"where it can affect standard errors and fit indices."
