#: R/texts.R
msgid ""
"With very large samples, even small, practically irrelevant deviations can "
"become statistically significant; it is worth also reviewing the Q-Q plot "
"or histogram of residuals before concluding."
msgstr ""

#: R/texts.R
msgid ""
"With very large samples, even trivial dependencies can become statistically "
"significant."
msgstr ""

#: R/texts.R
msgid "With very small samples (n < 20), the p-values may be unreliable."
